5,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! I'm going to look really closely at everyone to find the werewolf. Let's all be honest, okay? If you're acting weird, I'll definitely notice!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Let's keep a cool head. Emotional reactions can be misleading. I believe it's more effective to focus on logical inconsistencies and patterns of behavior rather than intuition. I'll be observing carefully.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. While enthusiasm is great, Rin, we should prioritize objective evidence. I'll be observing how everyone's logic evolves over the next few days to ensure we make the right decisions.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Toshio and Mizuki. Intuition is unreliable in a game of deception. I will be analyzing the structure of everyone's arguments to identify any logical gaps or contradictions. Let's maintain a rational approach.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,It seems we have a consensus on logic. I'll be watching how you all handle pressure. The way someone reacts when their logic is challenged often reveals more than the argument itself. Let's see who cracks first.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Everyone is being so serious! Logic is okay, but sometimes you just *know* when someone is lying! I'll be watching your faces and how you talk. I'm going to find the bad guy for sure!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, intuition has its place, but it's easily manipulated by a skilled liar. I prefer to establish a baseline of how everyone speaks now, so that any sudden shifts in behavior become obvious later.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Establishing a baseline is a sound strategy, Toshio. If we understand how everyone communicates under normal circumstances, any deviation during the heat of the debate will be much easier to spot. Let's keep our observations precise.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, @Mizuki, your focus on baselines is correct. However, we must also be wary of those who intentionally mimic a ""logical"" persona to blend in. Consistency is key, but blind trust in a pattern can be a trap.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a fair point. A curated persona is just another pattern to analyze. I'm more interested in the friction between your ""rationality"" and the actual pressure of the game. Let's see who maintains their mask.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"You guys talk like textbooks! It's just a game, right? But I'm still going to be the best detective ever! I'll find the werewolf by seeing who's trying too hard to sound smart!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, trying to sound smart is a valid observation, but we must be careful not to mistake a naturally analytical personality for deception. Let's focus on the facts as they emerge. I'll remain observant.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, your perspective is a useful counterweight. While we focus on logic, we shouldn't ignore the social dynamics. Let's all try to be transparent about our reasoning so we can cross-reference our findings effectively.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, transparency is a double-edged sword. While it helps the village, it also provides the werewolf with a map of our thought processes. We should be transparent, but we must remain critical of the ""evidence"" provided.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, you're overthinking the risk. The werewolf's fear isn't our transparency, but the inevitable contradictions that arise when they try to mirror it. I'll be waiting for those slips. It's always the most ""critical"" who stumble.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm not overthinking, I'm just being a detective! I'll keep my eyes wide open and find the werewolf no matter how smart they think they are! Good luck everyone, let's have fun!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I believe we have established a sufficient framework for today. I will continue to monitor the flow of information and the stability of everyone's arguments. Let us see what the first night reveals.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I believe we've set a productive tone for the game. By balancing logic with social observation, we'll be better equipped to uncover the truth. I look forward to seeing how the information unfolds tomorrow.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. We have a clear understanding of our respective methodologies. I will continue to analyze the discourse for any inconsistencies. Let us proceed to the first night.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
