28,0,4,talk,Shion,,The stage is set. I've noted your preferences and your masks. I'll be watching to see which of you is playing a role and which of you is actually thinking. Sleep well; the cracks will show tomorrow.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
